<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 mb-12">
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-1 uppercase italic">System_Administration</h1>
    <p class="text-base-content/40 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]">Direct control over the core database registry</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
  <div class="stats bg-base-200 border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
    <div class="stat p-8">
      <div class="stat-title text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2">Job_Signals</div>
      <div class="stat-value text-primary text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter"><%= @job_postings_count %></div>
      <div class="stat-actions mt-6">
        <%= link_to admin_job_postings_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-sm rounded-lg font-black tracking-widest text-[9px] w-full" do %>
          MANAGE_POSTINGS
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats bg-base-200 border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
    <div class="stat p-8">
      <div class="stat-title text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2">Managed_Entities</div>
      <div class="stat-value text-blue-400 text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter"><%= Company.count %></div>
      <div class="stat-actions mt-6">
        <%= link_to admin_companies_path, class: "btn btn-ghost border-white/10 btn-sm rounded-lg font-black tracking-widest text-[9px] w-full" do %>
          ENTITY_CONTROL
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats bg-base-200 border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
    <div class="stat p-8">
      <div class="stat-title text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2">Raw_Corpus</div>
      <div class="stat-value text-emerald-400 text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter"><%= @sources_count %></div>
      <div class="stat-actions mt-6">
        <button disabled class="btn btn-disabled btn-sm rounded-lg font-black tracking-widest text-[9px] w-full opacity-30">
          DOC_VIEW_LOCKED
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats bg-base-200 border border-white/5 shadow-xl">
    <div class="stat p-8">
      <div class="stat-title text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2">Active_Nodes</div>
      <div class="stat-value text-violet-400 text-5xl font-black tracking-tighter"><%= @active_fetchers_count %></div>
      <div class="stat-actions mt-6">
        <%= link_to data_fetchers_path, class: "btn btn-ghost border-white/10 btn-sm rounded-lg font-black tracking-widest text-[9px] w-full" do %>
          INGESTION_CONTROL
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<article class="bg-base-200 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-2xl">
  <h2 class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-base-content/30 mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-white/5">Administration_Protocol</h2>
  <div class="prose max-w-none text-sm font-medium text-base-content/60 leading-relaxed">
    <p>Welcome to the native Rails administration layer. This environment utilizes **DaisyUI 5** and **Tailwind 4** to provide a direct, low-overhead interface for system curation.</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-base-content/40">
      <li>Strict semantic markup following industry admin standards</li>
      <li>Official Dracula Pro palette integration (#22212C / #F8F8F2)</li>
      <li>Zero legacy asset dependencies</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</article>
